WEBVTT

01:30.550 --> 01:34.950
[The Heir]

01:35.270 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 4]

01:43.200 --> 01:44.400
Qiu'e, help me.

01:45.150 --> 01:45.789
Coming.

01:48.560 --> 01:50.310
You're working too hard.

01:50.710 --> 01:52.150
If your brother finds out,

01:52.150 --> 01:54.759
he will tell me off
for not taking good care of you.

01:54.759 --> 01:57.430
My family has spent
too much money on me these days.

01:57.430 --> 01:59.590
I need to hurry up and work

01:59.950 --> 02:01.430
to pay all the money back.

02:01.160 --> 02:02.500
[Li Zhengliang's fiancée, Du Qiu'e]

02:08.750 --> 02:09.520
Zhen.

02:10.190 --> 02:12.080
I saved this money myself.

02:12.310 --> 02:13.030
It's not much,

02:13.030 --> 02:13.710
but take it first.

02:13.710 --> 02:14.710
You need it more.

02:15.190 --> 02:17.079
I can't take the money, Qiu'e.

02:17.240 --> 02:18.120
Take it.

02:18.150 --> 02:18.590
Be good.

02:18.590 --> 02:20.079
I broke off an engagement
in public—

02:20.079 --> 02:22.050
people out there are all gossiping.

02:22.050 --> 02:23.760
I've implicated you and my brother.

02:23.760 --> 02:25.160
How can I take your money?

02:25.190 --> 02:26.520
I don't care about that.

02:27.000 --> 02:28.200
If your brother does,

02:28.310 --> 02:29.240
I won't marry him

02:29.280 --> 02:30.079
in the future.

02:30.710 --> 02:31.280
Take it.

02:31.520 --> 02:32.470
I really can't take it, Qiu'e.

02:32.470 --> 02:33.190
Excuse me.

02:34.190 --> 02:36.120
We'd like to pick some satin
to make wedding clothes

02:36.120 --> 02:36.870
for my daughter.

02:36.870 --> 02:38.470
Is there anything suitable?

02:42.630 --> 02:43.150
Yes.

02:43.150 --> 02:44.150
This way, please.

02:44.560 --> 02:45.310
Qiu'e.

02:45.430 --> 02:46.590
You continue with your work.

02:46.590 --> 02:47.850
I'll take care of them.

02:48.000 --> 02:48.430
Here.

02:48.470 --> 02:49.120
Miss.

02:49.520 --> 02:50.280
Take a look.

02:50.310 --> 02:52.030
These are new fabrics.

02:52.180 --> 02:54.340
These are red and gold

02:54.400 --> 02:55.800
cloud and phoenix satin.

02:56.000 --> 02:56.710
This one too.

02:56.710 --> 02:57.910
This has cranes on it.

02:58.079 --> 02:58.940
This is pretty.

02:59.000 --> 02:59.910
I can guarantee

02:59.910 --> 03:01.680
if you make this into your wedding gown,

03:01.680 --> 03:03.560
you'll be prettier than all the ladies

03:03.560 --> 03:04.910
on the streets.

03:05.120 --> 03:05.960
See how it looks on you.

03:05.960 --> 03:06.630
Try it.

03:07.240 --> 03:07.980
Does it look good?

03:07.980 --> 03:08.980
Yes!

03:09.010 --> 03:10.890
It complements your skin.

03:12.680 --> 03:13.360
That's it.

03:13.840 --> 03:14.520
Sure!

03:20.470 --> 03:21.360
Qiu'e, I'm leaving.

03:21.360 --> 03:22.150
Remember to lock the door.

03:22.150 --> 03:23.750
All right. See you tomorrow.

03:24.030 --> 03:24.680
Zhen.

03:29.150 --> 03:30.310
The shop is closed.

03:30.680 --> 03:32.030
If you want to buy cloth,

03:32.470 --> 03:33.430
come tomorrow.

03:34.910 --> 03:35.590
Zhen!

03:35.710 --> 03:36.470
Zhen!

03:36.960 --> 03:38.190
Listen to me, Zhen.

03:41.190 --> 03:41.910
Zhen.

03:42.680 --> 03:44.079
As long as you forgive me,

03:44.800 --> 03:46.600
you can scold me any way you want.

03:47.360 --> 03:48.150
I'll make it up to you

03:48.150 --> 03:49.360
100 to 1,000 times.

03:50.280 --> 03:51.280
I'll be extra good

03:51.590 --> 03:52.470
to you

03:52.800 --> 03:54.280
and your family.

03:56.150 --> 03:58.210
As long as you take back what you said,

03:58.520 --> 03:59.520
we can go back to the way we were—

03:59.520 --> 04:01.780
How can one take back hurt and deception?

04:05.960 --> 04:07.890
Return my birthday inkstick
to me.

04:08.470 --> 04:10.200
That's the only thing my father

04:11.190 --> 04:12.630
left to me in this world.

04:13.080 --> 04:13.840
Zhen.

04:15.590 --> 04:16.950
Is this really it for us?

04:17.390 --> 04:18.190
No, right?

04:18.630 --> 04:19.959
Give me another chance.

04:20.680 --> 04:21.810
One last time, Zhen.

04:21.920 --> 04:22.750
One last time.

04:22.800 --> 04:25.070
From the moment you set my brother up,

04:27.070 --> 04:28.630
we could never go back.

04:56.950 --> 04:57.800
Zhen.

04:59.000 --> 04:59.800
Zhen!

05:00.360 --> 05:01.000
Zhen—

05:19.070 --> 05:20.070
Zhen has been

05:20.720 --> 05:22.480
getting up earlier

05:22.950 --> 05:24.920
and working harder than before.

05:25.430 --> 05:27.490
She's acting like nothing happened,

05:28.430 --> 05:29.680
but I know

05:30.720 --> 05:32.270
she's very sad.

05:33.270 --> 05:34.600
If you want to,

05:34.830 --> 05:36.310
show your power.

05:37.260 --> 05:39.190
Help them resolve their problems.

05:40.120 --> 05:40.920
Can you?

05:44.890 --> 05:45.620
Hey!

05:45.640 --> 05:46.790
How old are you?

05:46.920 --> 05:48.159
So rude!

05:48.680 --> 05:50.340
Why are you back so late today?

05:50.800 --> 05:51.600
Father.

05:51.600 --> 05:52.480
Look.

05:52.600 --> 05:54.130
Mother is nagging me again.

05:54.600 --> 05:55.240
Father,

05:55.360 --> 05:56.680
Mother always told me

05:56.680 --> 05:58.000
she's very bold—

05:58.120 --> 06:01.000
that she didn't cry when she saw a tiger
when she was young.

06:01.000 --> 06:02.060
I don't believe it.

06:02.600 --> 06:03.920
I've already seen her crying

06:03.920 --> 06:05.630
a few times over the past few days.

06:05.630 --> 06:06.310
All right.

06:07.510 --> 06:09.630
I know you've been trying

06:09.630 --> 06:10.680
to cheer me up.

06:14.720 --> 06:15.560
I know

06:16.230 --> 06:18.680
you have guts and a mind of your own.

06:20.310 --> 06:21.160
But

06:22.270 --> 06:23.560
after what happened,

06:24.680 --> 06:26.800
your life will be hard.

06:27.270 --> 06:28.830
I'm afraid you'll be sad,

06:29.160 --> 06:30.310
that you'll suffer,

06:30.630 --> 06:33.159
and you'll keep it from us.

06:35.870 --> 06:36.920
I am sad.

06:37.750 --> 06:39.120
But what makes me sad is

06:40.390 --> 06:41.190
the humiliation brought upon you

06:41.190 --> 06:42.830
because of my marriage—

06:44.159 --> 06:45.490
especially to grandpa.

06:45.870 --> 06:46.600
I know

06:47.000 --> 06:49.720
although he has stopped making ink
all these years,

06:49.720 --> 06:52.520
he has still been
thinking about the ink industry.

06:53.510 --> 06:55.830
But the vow
he made on the spot this time

06:56.800 --> 06:59.120
has completely ruined that plan for him.

06:59.430 --> 07:01.230
If I need you to give up something

07:01.310 --> 07:02.970
in exchange for my happiness,

07:03.430 --> 07:05.120
I'd rather never get married.

07:05.190 --> 07:06.600
I'd rather stay at home

07:06.600 --> 07:08.030
to serve you and grandpa forever.

07:08.030 --> 07:09.490
Spouting nonsense again!

07:10.680 --> 07:12.000
Life is bitter

07:12.070 --> 07:13.360
and lonely.

07:17.870 --> 07:18.870
With Mother,

07:19.800 --> 07:21.040
I'm not afraid.

07:28.870 --> 07:29.920
Mother.

07:30.560 --> 07:31.720
I'm hungry.

07:31.750 --> 07:33.510
Grandpa and Brother will be back soon.

07:33.510 --> 07:34.680
Go cook for us.

07:37.870 --> 07:39.070
All right, all right.

07:39.830 --> 07:41.000
I'll go cook for you.

08:06.830 --> 08:07.510
Father,

08:09.430 --> 08:11.040
if you're listening,

08:12.120 --> 08:13.870
please comfort Mother for me.

08:17.270 --> 08:18.560
Have her

08:19.190 --> 08:20.510
not cry anymore,

08:21.120 --> 08:21.950
all right?

09:41.120 --> 09:42.150
Just cry.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.480
Crying

09:45.270 --> 09:46.720
is a good thing.

09:48.870 --> 09:50.510
Cry your heart out.

09:52.030 --> 09:53.480
Say goodbye

09:54.360 --> 09:55.320
to your past.

10:37.120 --> 10:37.840
Zhen.

10:46.030 --> 10:47.200
Still ignoring me?

10:47.200 --> 10:48.200
No, Zhen.

10:48.270 --> 10:49.750
I've been wanting to see you.

10:49.750 --> 10:51.120
It's because of my brother.

10:51.120 --> 10:52.630
Were you going to

10:52.720 --> 10:54.200
never come see me

10:54.360 --> 10:55.840
or talk to me

10:55.840 --> 10:57.080
because of your brother?

10:57.080 --> 10:58.440
How could that be, Zhen?

10:58.440 --> 10:59.550
Don't get me wrong.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.120
I...

11:00.790 --> 11:02.200
All right, silly.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.660
I'm just pulling your leg.

11:06.080 --> 11:06.910
Ronghua.

11:07.150 --> 11:09.270
Actually, I've been scared lately.

11:09.480 --> 11:11.480
I was also afraid that

11:11.480 --> 11:12.840
you'd ignore me because of this.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.750
Zhen.

11:13.750 --> 11:15.270
Why would I ignore you?

11:15.270 --> 11:17.390
It was my brother's fault.

11:17.390 --> 11:18.750
And we swore

11:18.790 --> 11:20.360
to be good sisters forever.

11:20.390 --> 11:21.550
If you can't be my sister-in-law,

11:21.550 --> 11:23.350
we'll still be sisters forever.

11:26.870 --> 11:28.120
Thank you, Ronghua.

11:28.670 --> 11:29.510
Thank you.

11:29.790 --> 11:30.960
You're terrible!

11:30.960 --> 11:32.890
You're just teasing me on purpose!

11:35.360 --> 11:36.480
Buy me sweet soup!

11:37.630 --> 11:38.080
Sure.

11:38.080 --> 11:39.440
I'll buy you sweet soup.

11:39.960 --> 11:40.600
Come.

11:41.150 --> 11:42.480
Don't be angry anymore.

11:42.550 --> 11:43.270
Ma'am!

11:43.510 --> 11:44.240
A pot of tea, please!

11:44.240 --> 11:46.150
-Coming.
Ink for sale!

11:46.550 --> 11:48.080
Fine ink!
Excuse me,

11:48.240 --> 11:49.120
what would you like to have?

11:49.120 --> 11:50.080
Shexian Lotus Heart.

11:50.080 --> 11:51.630
Ink for sale!

11:51.630 --> 11:52.320
There's an ink seller.

11:52.320 --> 11:53.600
Fine ink!

11:53.600 --> 11:54.320
What ink are you selling?

11:54.320 --> 11:55.320
Let me have a look.

11:55.390 --> 11:55.670
Sure.

11:55.670 --> 11:56.790
Show us.

12:02.510 --> 12:03.150
Here.

12:03.360 --> 12:04.480
How much is the ink?

12:04.910 --> 12:05.840
If you want it,

12:05.960 --> 12:07.360
I'll sell it for one tael.

12:15.870 --> 12:17.000
Your ink

12:17.080 --> 12:18.610
is worth one tael of silver?

12:19.440 --> 12:20.200
Sir,

12:20.240 --> 12:21.910
it's top-quality ink.

12:22.790 --> 12:23.510
Sirs,

12:23.510 --> 12:24.080
your tea.

12:24.080 --> 12:25.610
You're not a local, are you?

12:26.270 --> 12:27.550
The best inks in the world

12:27.550 --> 12:28.610
are all in Huizhou.

12:28.840 --> 12:30.270
The best among Huizhou inks are

12:30.270 --> 12:32.000
Luo Ink, Li Ink, and Chen Ink.

12:33.010 --> 12:34.170
I'm afraid even

12:34.200 --> 12:36.320
a 3-year-old kid in Huizhou
could make this ink.

12:36.320 --> 12:38.120
And you're selling it for a tael?

12:38.540 --> 12:39.600
Sell it elsewhere.

12:39.720 --> 12:40.440
Hey, my...

12:40.460 --> 12:41.180
Go, go.

12:45.000 --> 12:45.630
Sir.

12:46.440 --> 12:47.910
Anyone who visits is a guest.

12:47.910 --> 12:49.480
Would you like a cup of tea?

12:49.510 --> 12:50.200
Well...

12:50.200 --> 12:51.030
It's free.

12:51.030 --> 12:51.750
Come on.

12:54.480 --> 12:55.120
Here.

12:59.320 --> 13:00.270
Thank you, miss.

13:00.910 --> 13:01.670
Sir,

13:01.960 --> 13:04.030
can I see the ink in your hand?

13:04.870 --> 13:05.510
Thank you.

13:11.660 --> 13:14.020
The inscription looks very special.

13:17.030 --> 13:19.490
The ink contains
various shell powders too.

13:20.030 --> 13:22.670
You use more materials than the Luo family would.

13:22.670 --> 13:24.000
Is the origin of this ink

13:24.080 --> 13:25.080
from the coast?

13:25.300 --> 13:26.960
You are knowledgeable, miss.

13:27.120 --> 13:29.150
This ink is of good quality.

13:29.550 --> 13:30.510
In my opinion,

13:30.510 --> 13:32.510
this ink is worth a tael

13:32.510 --> 13:33.200
or two.

13:33.240 --> 13:34.440
You're right.

13:35.360 --> 13:38.020
The extra ingredients in the ink
are secondary.

13:38.200 --> 13:40.320
What's rare is the main material used.

13:40.320 --> 13:42.270
This is no ordinary pine,

13:42.390 --> 13:45.240
but the dwarf black pine
from the coastal regions.

13:45.440 --> 13:46.440
Dwarf black pine?

13:46.870 --> 13:48.030
According to ancient books,

13:48.030 --> 13:48.960
dwarf black pine

13:49.030 --> 13:50.200
has a burnt color

13:50.200 --> 13:51.390
and touches like cream.

13:51.390 --> 13:52.550
If it's used to make ink,

13:52.550 --> 13:53.840
the ink'd be top quality.

13:53.840 --> 13:55.910
But it grows slowly—

13:56.000 --> 13:57.750
barely three inches a year—

13:57.840 --> 14:00.120
so it's very precious.

14:01.080 --> 14:03.200
It took me a lot of effort

14:03.320 --> 14:04.510
to get this ink.

14:05.790 --> 14:08.670
But I didn't expect
that it wouldn't sell

14:09.000 --> 14:11.000
no matter how much I lower the price.

14:11.390 --> 14:13.520
Outsiders normally only know Hui Ink,

14:13.630 --> 14:17.070
and among Hui Ink, people only recognize
the three main families.

14:17.070 --> 14:18.670
Not many people would believe it

14:18.670 --> 14:21.400
even if I tell them what's special
about this ink.

14:23.030 --> 14:24.490
Don't be too discouraged.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.270
In my opinion,

14:26.480 --> 14:28.600
since this ink is unique

14:28.670 --> 14:31.360
and the ink-blending technique
is different from local ones,

14:31.360 --> 14:33.240
you can sell it to an ink workshop

14:33.240 --> 14:34.200
as a reference.

14:34.390 --> 14:35.790
The three families

14:35.870 --> 14:37.120
of Hui Ink—as you just mentioned—

14:37.120 --> 14:39.650
I'm sure any of them
will buy it at a high price.

14:40.870 --> 14:43.130
This is something I've never thought of.

14:43.200 --> 14:44.390
Thank you for your guidance.

14:44.390 --> 14:45.320
You're welcome.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.840
Your... Your ink!

14:47.840 --> 14:49.120
You have a discerning eye.

14:49.120 --> 14:50.750
I can't repay you just for giving me tea.

14:50.750 --> 14:52.810
Please take this ink as a return gift.

15:41.360 --> 15:42.480
Take care, sir.

15:42.480 --> 15:43.360
Busy, Mr. Shui?

15:43.600 --> 15:44.240
Yes.

15:44.240 --> 15:44.600
Take care.

15:44.600 --> 15:45.910
Mr. Shui, the bill, please!

15:45.910 --> 15:46.440
Let's go.

15:46.480 --> 15:48.080
Wait for me. I'll get some food.

15:48.080 --> 15:49.480
Let's go. Let's eat on the way.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.120
Let's go.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.080
Mr. Shui.

15:55.790 --> 15:56.600
Mr. Shui,

15:57.120 --> 15:59.240
why are there so many people today?

16:00.360 --> 16:03.390
Today is the day
the Luo family chooses pine materials.

16:03.390 --> 16:05.860
If your pine gets selected
by Eldest Young Master Luo,

16:05.860 --> 16:08.570
you will make a huge fortune.

16:08.600 --> 16:10.000
That explains the crowd.

16:10.630 --> 16:13.000
Doesn't the Luo family
have their own pine farm?

16:13.000 --> 16:15.390
Since the Luo family
won the rights to Tribute Ink,

16:15.390 --> 16:17.870
they've received a huge number
of orders.

16:18.720 --> 16:19.840
I also heard that

16:20.360 --> 16:21.720
the Luo family recently

16:21.720 --> 16:23.120
received a huge order.

16:23.550 --> 16:25.320
I guess that's why.

16:26.360 --> 16:28.360
No wonder he's become more arrogant

16:28.670 --> 16:30.080
every time I see him now.

16:30.580 --> 16:32.050
[Selection Invitation]

16:34.910 --> 16:35.720
Mr. Shui.

16:36.150 --> 16:38.000
Why is there a document here?

16:39.720 --> 16:41.320
The Chen family from Lin'an?

16:41.790 --> 16:44.870
They must've left this behind
when they left in a hurry.

16:45.030 --> 16:45.910
You're fast.

16:46.120 --> 16:47.150
Take it to them.

16:47.150 --> 16:48.440
Don't delay them.

16:49.270 --> 16:50.150
I'll go now.

16:50.150 --> 16:51.410
Don't worry, Mr. Shui.

16:55.080 --> 16:55.870
I...

16:56.910 --> 16:58.370
I finally caught up with you.

16:58.370 --> 16:59.320
Zhen, why are you here?

16:59.320 --> 17:00.580
You left your document

17:00.910 --> 17:02.080
at the tea shop.

17:04.550 --> 17:05.720
Thank you, Zhen.

17:05.829 --> 17:06.680
Unfortunately,

17:06.680 --> 17:08.339
God didn't give us the chance.

17:08.880 --> 17:10.280
You ran here for nothing.

17:10.310 --> 17:11.109
This document

17:11.750 --> 17:12.609
is now useless.

17:13.160 --> 17:15.680
Did the pine selection end early?

17:15.890 --> 17:17.200
It hasn't even started yet.

17:17.200 --> 17:18.460
Don't even mention it.

17:19.030 --> 17:20.030
That Young Master of the Luo family,

17:20.030 --> 17:22.069
even before
we could introduce our pine,

17:22.069 --> 17:22.920
glanced at our goods

17:22.920 --> 17:24.510
and humiliated us by saying,

17:24.510 --> 17:27.200
how dare we try to sell
such low-quality goods to them.

17:27.200 --> 17:27.589
So,

17:27.589 --> 17:29.310
we were kicked out

17:29.960 --> 17:31.510
before we even met the pine appraiser.

17:31.510 --> 17:32.110
Forget it.

17:32.110 --> 17:32.920
The Luo family

17:33.270 --> 17:35.000
is too high-and-mighty for us!

17:35.030 --> 17:36.680
But we have so much pine.

17:37.130 --> 17:38.280
If the Luo family doesn't take it,

17:38.280 --> 17:39.350
who will?

17:41.640 --> 17:43.170
What a terrible situation.

17:51.400 --> 17:52.240
Come over.

17:53.160 --> 17:53.920
Quick.

17:58.030 --> 17:59.510
I might have a way

17:59.640 --> 18:00.440
to get the Luo family

18:00.440 --> 18:02.680
to buy your pine materials
at a high price.

18:02.680 --> 18:04.270
But you shouldn't spread it around

18:04.270 --> 18:05.870
once you get this advantage.

18:07.920 --> 18:08.550
Please.

18:08.550 --> 18:09.550
Thank you.

18:10.160 --> 18:11.290
Wait for my message.

18:15.920 --> 18:16.830
Say something.

18:17.880 --> 18:19.110
The pine appraiser

18:19.550 --> 18:21.000
suddenly fell ill

18:21.240 --> 18:22.570
and can't come anymore.

18:22.640 --> 18:24.300
Why didn't you say so earlier?

18:24.440 --> 18:25.480
We need to choose

18:25.480 --> 18:27.440
the best quality pine today.

18:27.550 --> 18:28.310
I won't be able to pick

18:28.310 --> 18:29.750
so much wood by myself.

18:31.550 --> 18:32.240
Eldest Young Master,

18:32.240 --> 18:34.960
I-I can't find someone else
on such short notice.

18:34.960 --> 18:36.000
This is Huizhou.

18:36.000 --> 18:37.310
Ink workshops are everywhere.

18:37.310 --> 18:38.440
Find someone for me!

18:38.480 --> 18:40.080
Don't come back if you can't!

18:42.030 --> 18:42.720
Useless!

18:46.030 --> 18:46.920
You

18:47.000 --> 18:48.070
dropped your shoe.

18:48.160 --> 18:49.960
Who's laughing there?

18:51.590 --> 18:53.000
Well,

18:53.050 --> 18:54.350
isn't this the famous Miss Li Zhen
of Huizhou,

18:54.350 --> 18:55.880
who broke off an engagement

18:56.130 --> 18:58.530
so publicly on the streets?

18:58.560 --> 18:59.920
Such high praise, Eldest Young Master Luo.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.270
It's thanks to you

19:01.270 --> 19:03.470
that I have Huizhou attached to my name.

19:04.400 --> 19:06.160
I'm flattered, Miss Li Zhen.

19:06.590 --> 19:09.200
I just seized the opportunity—

19:09.200 --> 19:11.260
though this had nothing to do with me.

19:12.000 --> 19:13.200
Thankfully, this situation is over.

19:13.200 --> 19:14.000
Otherwise,

19:14.110 --> 19:15.790
you'd have taken

19:15.790 --> 19:17.450
every opportunity possible.

19:18.920 --> 19:20.200
You know me well.

19:21.680 --> 19:23.030
Miss Li Zhen,

19:23.510 --> 19:25.790
why are you here?

19:26.200 --> 19:27.110
I heard that

19:27.110 --> 19:28.720
you need a pine appraiser.

19:29.310 --> 19:30.770
I'm here to appraise pine.

19:31.030 --> 19:32.160
You? Appraise pine?

19:33.640 --> 19:36.110
Every piece of pine wood here
watched you grow up.

19:36.110 --> 19:37.570
You want to appraise them?

19:37.640 --> 19:38.510
On what basis?

19:38.510 --> 19:40.310
Just on the fact that I am
the top of the Five Ink-making Grandmasters,

19:40.310 --> 19:41.970
Li Jinshui's granddaughter.

19:42.240 --> 19:43.550
Ever since I first learned to read,

19:43.550 --> 19:45.510
my eyes have known
only ink recipes.

19:45.510 --> 19:46.590
It's just appraising pine wood—

19:46.590 --> 19:47.640
that's nothing hard.

19:47.640 --> 19:48.720
How arrogant.

19:49.550 --> 19:50.720
Mr. Luo,

19:50.830 --> 19:52.230
do you dare to bet with me?

19:52.720 --> 19:54.160
Let's appraise the pine separately.

19:54.160 --> 19:55.000
If the ones I pick

19:55.000 --> 19:56.330
match the ones you pick,

19:56.350 --> 19:57.400
that means

19:57.680 --> 19:59.480
I can earn the title of a pine appraiser

19:59.480 --> 20:01.000
and be paid like one.

20:01.030 --> 20:02.440
And what if you don't?

20:08.350 --> 20:09.680
In that case,

20:10.680 --> 20:12.270
you can have this inkstick.

20:18.110 --> 20:19.880
You're betting with my young master

20:19.880 --> 20:21.750
with ink of this quality?

20:23.790 --> 20:24.550
Sure.

20:25.270 --> 20:26.920
I'll use this ink as a stake.

20:27.570 --> 20:28.890
If you choose well,

20:28.910 --> 20:30.710
not only will you get the reward,

20:30.750 --> 20:32.590
I'll give you another 10 taels.

20:32.590 --> 20:33.480
Young Master.

20:36.110 --> 20:37.110
What do you think?

20:37.960 --> 20:38.830
It's a deal.

21:11.750 --> 21:12.750
Miss Li Zhen.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.100
It's your turn.

21:22.240 --> 21:23.640
She's so young,

21:23.640 --> 21:25.350
what does she know?

21:25.480 --> 21:27.140
Does she know what to look for?

21:27.630 --> 21:28.350
Excuse me.

21:28.380 --> 21:29.010
Excuse me.

21:51.350 --> 21:52.750
You've made your choice?

21:54.980 --> 21:55.520
Come.

22:08.950 --> 22:10.350
[Zhao] [Feng] [Jiang]

22:12.160 --> 22:13.490
Did you see what I wrote?

22:14.270 --> 22:15.110
I, Li Zhen,

22:15.200 --> 22:17.060
will never do something so lowly.

22:21.400 --> 22:23.790
Interesting, Miss Li Zhen.

22:28.000 --> 22:29.640
Very interesting.

22:30.350 --> 22:32.640
Mr. Luo, please keep your word.

22:33.350 --> 22:36.310
Take Miss Li Zhen to get her payment
from the Luo family's accounting office.

22:36.310 --> 22:37.400
Yes, Young Master.

22:37.640 --> 22:38.240
Wait.

22:39.070 --> 22:40.040
Mr. Luo,

22:40.070 --> 22:41.110
are you really

22:41.640 --> 22:43.500
just going to choose these three?

22:46.030 --> 22:48.240
What do you mean?

22:49.310 --> 22:50.830
But the best pine material

22:50.880 --> 22:51.830
is not here.

22:52.350 --> 22:53.240
Then,

22:53.440 --> 22:55.960
where is the best pine?

23:03.650 --> 23:04.270
Okay.

23:04.550 --> 23:05.240
Deal.

23:07.590 --> 23:09.190
The Chen family from Lin'an!

23:10.000 --> 23:10.600
Come over.

23:10.680 --> 23:11.240
All right!

23:11.240 --> 23:11.960
Coming!

23:11.960 --> 23:12.510
Come!

23:12.550 --> 23:13.030
He picked us!

23:13.030 --> 23:14.240
Turn around now!

23:20.510 --> 23:22.270
This wood is dark

23:22.270 --> 23:23.670
and its texture is rough.

23:23.880 --> 23:25.510
Not to mention my young master,

23:25.510 --> 23:28.110
even I've never seen
such low-quality pine.

23:28.400 --> 23:28.880
Do...

23:28.960 --> 23:30.640
Do you think we are fools?

23:31.680 --> 23:33.310
Normally,

23:33.440 --> 23:35.680
good quality pine is light in color

23:35.960 --> 23:37.310
and smooth in texture.

23:37.720 --> 23:39.480
But according to ancient books,

23:39.480 --> 23:40.680
dwarf black pine

23:40.750 --> 23:41.990
has a jet-black color

23:42.030 --> 23:43.510
and feels as smooth as cream.

23:43.510 --> 23:44.590
If it's used to make ink,

23:44.590 --> 23:45.990
the ink'd be top quality.

23:46.480 --> 23:48.480
But it grows slowly—

23:48.680 --> 23:51.200
Less than three inches each year.

23:51.270 --> 23:51.960
Therefore,

23:52.070 --> 23:53.270
it's very precious.

24:00.720 --> 24:03.750
Is this the dwarf black pine
you mentioned?

24:06.440 --> 24:07.400
Mr. Luo,

24:08.030 --> 24:08.920
why don't you

24:09.110 --> 24:10.770
take a closer look at this ink?

24:16.270 --> 24:18.240
You are devoted to making ink.

24:18.790 --> 24:20.250
It's not difficult for you

24:20.410 --> 24:22.140
to see if I'm telling the truth.

24:25.640 --> 24:26.920
Miss Li Zhen.

24:28.240 --> 24:30.200
Dwarf black pine

24:30.640 --> 24:31.960
is indeed fine.

24:35.550 --> 24:36.400
Ping'an.

24:37.350 --> 24:38.440
Add this to the warehouse log.

24:38.440 --> 24:39.030
All right.

24:39.030 --> 24:39.750
Remember,

24:40.160 --> 24:41.720
put this batch of pine wood

24:42.240 --> 24:43.590
in the south warehouse.

24:43.750 --> 24:45.720
It has to be somewhere dry
to avoid bug infestation.

24:45.720 --> 24:46.510
Got it?

24:46.550 --> 24:48.750
Due to the dampness
of where it's grown,

24:48.790 --> 24:50.000
the storage of dwarf black pine

24:50.000 --> 24:52.110
is also different
from that of ordinary pine.

24:52.110 --> 24:53.160
It must be placed somewhere

24:53.160 --> 24:54.880
dark and humid.

24:55.110 --> 24:55.680
Otherwise,

24:55.680 --> 24:56.440
the inkstick would easily crack

24:56.440 --> 24:58.270
when it's used to make ink.

24:58.790 --> 24:59.750
Miss Li Zhen.

25:07.270 --> 25:08.070
Here you go,

25:08.200 --> 25:09.530
the silver you deserve.

25:13.750 --> 25:15.240
Do you need to weigh it?

25:16.480 --> 25:17.110
No.

25:17.400 --> 25:18.330
I've counted it.

25:18.400 --> 25:19.330
Not a penny less.

25:21.440 --> 25:22.040
By the way,

25:22.110 --> 25:22.920
Mr. Luo,

25:23.680 --> 25:25.410
I have a presumptuous request.

25:25.550 --> 25:27.920
I came to appraise pine today on a whim.

25:28.000 --> 25:30.070
I hope you won't spread the word.

25:30.510 --> 25:31.270
No problem.

25:31.790 --> 25:33.750
I also have a favor to ask.

25:34.550 --> 25:35.030
Sit.

25:37.440 --> 25:38.880
We don't have that many rules here.

25:38.880 --> 25:39.480
Sit.

25:44.350 --> 25:45.110
Miss,

25:46.440 --> 25:47.350
I want to

25:48.350 --> 25:51.080
invite you to work for the Luo family—
how's that?

25:56.350 --> 25:58.270
Mr. Luo,

25:58.270 --> 26:00.270
you're someone I'd normally avoid.

26:03.590 --> 26:05.640
What do you know about me?

26:08.240 --> 26:09.750
If you want to judge me,

26:09.750 --> 26:11.680
it's useless to say anything else.

26:12.070 --> 26:13.600
All I care about in this life

26:13.750 --> 26:15.200
is ink.

26:16.230 --> 26:18.200
I hate the Tian family

26:18.480 --> 26:20.480
for tainting the reputation of ink.

26:21.110 --> 26:22.750
If you're interested in ink,

26:23.350 --> 26:24.350
I like you.

26:25.720 --> 26:28.380
Your family has a great recipe
for ink blending,

26:29.830 --> 26:32.510
so I wanted to get it by any means.

26:34.960 --> 26:35.960
At this point in time,

26:35.960 --> 26:36.880
Miss Li Zhen,

26:37.510 --> 26:38.680
I, Luo Wensong,

26:40.510 --> 26:42.240
would like to apologize to you.

26:52.510 --> 26:54.440
I'm sincere about

26:54.680 --> 26:56.310
hiring you.

26:57.480 --> 26:59.830
I cherish your talent for ink making.

27:01.750 --> 27:02.590
Talent?

27:03.000 --> 27:04.960
Being talented doesn't mean I like it.

27:04.960 --> 27:06.070
In Huizhou,

27:06.200 --> 27:08.160
the ink industry is huge.

27:08.240 --> 27:10.070
Some obsess over it all their lives—

27:10.070 --> 27:11.330
and what comes of that?

27:12.250 --> 27:13.890
It's good enough for me

27:13.920 --> 27:16.030
to use my talent to cheat you

27:16.030 --> 27:17.030
out of your money.

27:18.110 --> 27:19.480
I can tell

27:19.550 --> 27:21.010
whether you like it or not.

27:22.830 --> 27:23.920
People often talk about

27:23.920 --> 27:27.160
how someone is talented at something,

27:28.550 --> 27:30.200
but they're just not interested in it

27:30.200 --> 27:31.400
and thus waste their time

27:31.400 --> 27:32.240
and their talent.

27:32.240 --> 27:34.070
That's bullshit.

27:34.750 --> 27:36.310
If you don't like it or obsess over it,

27:36.310 --> 27:37.790
that's not talent.

27:38.110 --> 27:39.960
Even if you get things right
sometimes—

27:39.960 --> 27:41.880
that's just sometimes.

27:42.920 --> 27:45.590
It's not just sometimes for you.

27:46.200 --> 27:47.790
I could tell when you were

27:48.070 --> 27:49.590
appraising the pine just now.

27:49.590 --> 27:52.160
If you don't care about ink,

27:52.240 --> 27:54.400
how could you know it so well?

27:54.960 --> 27:55.640
Besides,

27:56.750 --> 27:57.480
Li Zhen,

27:58.640 --> 27:59.720
your family

28:00.200 --> 28:01.550
has been eliminated.

28:02.350 --> 28:04.750
Li Jinshui swore never to make ink again.

28:05.400 --> 28:08.030
If you really want to work with ink,

28:08.590 --> 28:10.310
and you don't come to the Luo family,

28:10.310 --> 28:12.240
do you have a better place to go?

28:13.960 --> 28:15.400
I'm curious too.

28:15.920 --> 28:16.920
I'm a woman.

28:17.200 --> 28:18.110
If you take me in,

28:18.110 --> 28:19.400
it's against the industry rules

28:19.400 --> 28:21.860
and the interests of the Li and Luo families.

28:22.000 --> 28:23.350
Aren't you afraid that the Li family

28:23.350 --> 28:24.750
would invoke the Founder's Black Banner

28:24.750 --> 28:26.480
and come knocking at your door?

28:26.680 --> 28:28.140
Let me show you something.

28:34.920 --> 28:36.550
My aunt, Luo Mengzhen,

28:37.030 --> 28:38.830
gave this to me when I was three.

28:40.590 --> 28:41.790
Let me put it this way—

28:42.400 --> 28:45.070
half of the Luo family's ink business

28:45.400 --> 28:47.830
was established by my aunt, Luo Mengzhen.

28:48.270 --> 28:49.720
She was a woman too.

28:50.720 --> 28:51.510
Rules?

28:52.000 --> 28:53.550
What are rules for?

28:53.640 --> 28:55.400
They are to get things done.

28:55.590 --> 28:56.480
To achieve something,

28:56.480 --> 28:57.750
if you need to break the rules,

28:57.750 --> 28:58.750
then break them.

29:03.440 --> 29:04.680
And your aunt...

29:09.400 --> 29:12.030
Red ink marks
and blots out the dust before my eyes,

29:12.030 --> 29:15.230
this year's spring has vanished
before I knew it was here.

29:16.880 --> 29:17.830
The only person

29:19.350 --> 29:21.240
I respect in Huizhou

29:22.030 --> 29:24.000
is my aunt, Luo Mengzhen.

29:29.640 --> 29:30.480
Mr. Luo.

29:30.480 --> 29:31.960
At the end of the day,

29:32.240 --> 29:34.550
it was just because your pine appraiser
was sick today

29:34.550 --> 29:36.270
and you needed temporary help.

29:36.270 --> 29:38.610
Where did all this talk come from?

29:39.160 --> 29:40.290
I don't understand.

29:40.680 --> 29:43.590
Whether I take the path
of the ink industry or not

29:43.790 --> 29:46.000
has nothing to do with you.

29:47.880 --> 29:48.440
Goodbye.

29:53.920 --> 29:54.520
Oh, right.

29:54.920 --> 29:56.030
I forgot to mention this—

29:56.030 --> 29:57.030
dwarf black pine

29:57.030 --> 29:58.550
should be kept away from light.

29:58.550 --> 29:59.640
If you don't believe me,

29:59.640 --> 30:01.170
go check the ancient books.

30:17.320 --> 30:20.160
Enter the altar!

30:29.170 --> 30:32.170
Welcome the deity!

30:46.200 --> 30:47.110
Mother!

30:48.720 --> 30:49.310
Mother!

30:50.680 --> 30:51.240
Mother!

30:51.710 --> 30:52.640
Guess what?

30:52.790 --> 30:54.920
Today, I appraised pine
for the Luo family

30:54.920 --> 30:55.750
and earned

30:55.880 --> 30:57.530
a reward of 20 taels!

31:00.350 --> 31:01.240
What's wrong, Mother?

31:01.240 --> 31:03.570
Aren't you happy even though I made money?

31:04.270 --> 31:05.750
Your grandpa insisted on going back
to the ancestral home

31:05.750 --> 31:07.440
to attend the Li family's
centennial ritual.

31:07.440 --> 31:08.720
I couldn't stop him!

31:09.000 --> 31:10.330
The centennial ritual?

31:10.590 --> 31:11.550
Why would he go?

31:11.720 --> 31:13.200
Our family has been eliminated.

31:13.200 --> 31:14.680
Wouldn't going there
be inviting humiliation?

31:14.680 --> 31:15.830
Exactly.

31:15.880 --> 31:16.750
But your grandpa

31:16.750 --> 31:18.350
dragged your brother along.

31:22.590 --> 31:23.240
Zhen!

31:23.830 --> 31:24.480
Zhen!

31:30.880 --> 31:32.240
Kneel!

31:39.440 --> 31:40.510
Bow!

31:43.070 --> 31:44.310
Rise!

31:46.030 --> 31:47.510
Up!

31:51.030 --> 31:52.200
Kneel!

31:56.270 --> 31:57.440
Bow!

31:59.240 --> 32:00.350
Rise!

32:00.350 --> 32:02.480
Didn't Eighth Master Li get expelled?

32:02.680 --> 32:04.410
It's the centennial ceremony.

32:04.650 --> 32:06.410
The ancestors can refuse to acknowledge
Eighth Master Li,

32:06.410 --> 32:08.740
but he cannot refuse to acknowledge them.

32:23.160 --> 32:25.200
Read the invocations!

32:26.070 --> 32:28.830
I shall serve you.

32:41.590 --> 32:42.790
Kneel!

32:45.790 --> 32:46.720
Bow!

32:46.790 --> 32:48.960
The Eighth Branch is so shameless.

32:49.640 --> 32:50.830
Rise!

32:52.830 --> 32:53.660
Up!

32:54.200 --> 32:55.160
Eighth Uncle.

32:57.200 --> 32:59.480
As an incompetent elder,

32:59.720 --> 33:01.350
don't be an eyesore here.

33:01.350 --> 33:02.310
Bow!

33:03.200 --> 33:04.000
You...

33:04.480 --> 33:05.340
Li Zhengliang.

33:06.000 --> 33:08.310
Your father got drunk and made a mistake,

33:08.440 --> 33:10.640
causing the Li family to lose
the right to Tribute Ink

33:10.640 --> 33:12.840
and causing my husband, Jingqi, to die.

33:13.160 --> 33:14.310
Everyone,

33:14.440 --> 33:15.720
what right do they have

33:15.720 --> 33:17.160
to worship their ancestors here?

33:17.160 --> 33:19.440
Eighth Master Li is just bowing
in front of the ancestral hall.

33:19.440 --> 33:20.400
He didn't go in.

33:20.680 --> 33:22.720
Why are you being so aggressive?

33:22.810 --> 33:23.830
That's right.

33:23.830 --> 33:25.110
That's right.

33:25.430 --> 33:26.780
Am I being aggressive?

33:26.960 --> 33:28.960
He drove my family to their deaths.

33:28.980 --> 33:30.440
Can't I say anything about them?

33:30.440 --> 33:32.400
They are the sinners of the Li family.

33:32.400 --> 33:34.440
Not to mention
in front of the ancestral hall,

33:34.440 --> 33:35.590
they should feel ashamed

33:35.590 --> 33:36.510
to even be in

33:36.510 --> 33:38.440
Shexian or Huizhou.

33:38.790 --> 33:39.880
Bow!

33:40.200 --> 33:42.200
Stop kowtowing here.

33:42.790 --> 33:44.400
You jinx.

33:44.550 --> 33:45.510
You will forever be sorry

33:45.510 --> 33:47.480
to our ancestors.

33:47.480 --> 33:50.070
You deserve to be condemned
forever.

33:50.830 --> 33:51.960
Grandpa, let's go.

33:52.880 --> 33:54.280
The ceremony continues.

33:55.270 --> 33:56.030
Guards,

33:56.400 --> 33:57.590
remove them.

33:58.160 --> 33:59.220
What are you doing?

33:59.310 --> 33:59.830
What are you doing?

33:59.830 --> 34:00.560
Zhengliang.

34:00.880 --> 34:01.610
Zhengliang!

34:01.720 --> 34:02.450
Zhengliang.

34:03.400 --> 34:04.800
Causing a scene in public

34:04.880 --> 34:06.070
and disgracing our ancestors

34:06.070 --> 34:07.270
is something we shouldn't do.

34:07.270 --> 34:07.920
Grandpa.

34:07.920 --> 34:08.670
Zhengliang.

34:08.710 --> 34:10.239
Something we shouldn't do?

34:11.070 --> 34:12.360
Look at the state the Eighth Branch

34:12.360 --> 34:13.800
has brought the Li family to today.

34:13.800 --> 34:15.630
What have you not done?

34:17.030 --> 34:17.760
If I were you,

34:17.760 --> 34:19.070
I would have gone to the underworld

34:19.070 --> 34:22.000
and asked Jingqi and our ancestors
for forgiveness.

34:23.110 --> 34:24.310
If it weren't for you,

34:24.330 --> 34:25.320
Jingqi would have been

34:25.320 --> 34:27.480
the next head of the Li family.

34:28.400 --> 34:30.199
I would've been the clan matron.

34:31.400 --> 34:33.070
The Eighth Branch will forever

34:33.070 --> 34:34.550
be indebted to me!

34:45.400 --> 34:46.400
Jingqi's wife,

34:47.320 --> 34:48.230
hate me

34:49.030 --> 34:50.230
if you want.

34:50.960 --> 34:52.360
That's useless.

34:52.960 --> 34:55.360
If I hate you,
will Jingqi come back to life?

34:55.800 --> 34:57.000
You all should die.

34:57.000 --> 34:58.280
Die!

34:58.630 --> 34:59.800
What are you waiting for?

34:59.800 --> 35:00.670
Go!

35:01.330 --> 35:01.960
We'll leave.

35:01.960 --> 35:02.630
Don't touch my grandpa!

35:02.630 --> 35:03.510
We'll leave.

35:03.670 --> 35:04.590
We'll leave.

35:05.400 --> 35:06.330
We'll leave now.

35:06.510 --> 35:07.440
We'll leave now.

35:07.670 --> 35:08.710
Li Zhengliang.

35:08.840 --> 35:10.280
This is the centennial ceremony.

35:10.280 --> 35:12.110
How dare you!

35:12.880 --> 35:14.280
Who do you think you are?

35:15.840 --> 35:16.510
Grandpa!

35:17.230 --> 35:17.980
-Grandpa!
-Grandpa!

35:17.980 --> 35:18.980
Are you all right?

35:20.910 --> 35:22.660
Look at this family.

35:23.760 --> 35:25.760
They say they wouldn't do anything,

35:25.960 --> 35:28.280
but here they are causing a ruckus.

35:28.920 --> 35:29.710
Li Zhen,

35:29.840 --> 35:31.920
you take after

35:32.000 --> 35:33.280
your shrewd and barbaric mother!

35:33.280 --> 35:35.440
That's why you're an unwanted,
cheap woman.

35:35.440 --> 35:36.320
What did you say?

35:36.320 --> 35:36.800
Say it again!

35:36.800 --> 35:37.550
Say that again!

35:37.550 --> 35:38.440
Say it again!

35:39.000 --> 35:39.630
You can insult me,

35:39.630 --> 35:40.630
but not my mother!

35:40.710 --> 35:42.000
Say it again, Tian Chanyue!

35:42.000 --> 35:42.630
Grandpa!

35:42.630 --> 35:43.110
Zhen!

35:43.110 --> 35:43.840
Say it again!

35:43.880 --> 35:45.070
Stop shouting!

35:51.620 --> 35:54.540
Today is the centennial ceremony for me,
Li Mo.

35:55.590 --> 35:57.510
What is the Eighth Branch doing?

35:57.880 --> 35:59.360
It wasn't us.

35:59.760 --> 36:01.110
Everyone saw it—

36:01.360 --> 36:02.800
she was the one who hit first.

36:02.800 --> 36:04.190
She hit first?

36:04.590 --> 36:06.920
If you had stayed at home,

36:07.060 --> 36:08.290
would she have hit you?

36:08.290 --> 36:08.670
You!

36:08.670 --> 36:09.400
Zhen.

36:10.630 --> 36:11.280
Zhen.

36:16.150 --> 36:16.920
Very well.

36:17.480 --> 36:18.740
It's an important day—

36:19.280 --> 36:20.760
I'll let this slide.

36:21.480 --> 36:22.190
Grandpa.

36:22.550 --> 36:23.680
Let's go home first.

36:24.280 --> 36:24.960
Let's go.

36:24.960 --> 36:26.070
Li Jinshui.

36:26.360 --> 36:29.400
How dare you
pay respect to your ancestors?

36:29.590 --> 36:31.630
First, your grandson stole the ink recipe,

36:31.630 --> 36:35.560
and then you let Zhen go to the Luo family
to make money appraising pine.

36:35.920 --> 36:38.880
Is this how one of
the Five Ink-making Grandmasters should act?

36:38.880 --> 36:41.840
That was not the vow you made!

36:48.360 --> 36:49.110
Zhen.

36:50.150 --> 36:51.350
What pine appraisal?

36:53.070 --> 36:54.230
At this point,

36:54.320 --> 36:55.480
drop the act.

36:55.630 --> 36:56.480
Don't you find it disgusting?

36:56.480 --> 36:57.110
Enough!

37:00.880 --> 37:02.000
Everyone knows

37:02.080 --> 37:03.440
what happened with the ink recipe.

37:03.440 --> 37:05.840
The Tian and Luo families
set my brother up.

37:06.000 --> 37:07.800
Even if my brother was careless,

37:07.960 --> 37:09.320
you blocked the bridal sedan in public

37:09.320 --> 37:10.950
and forced Grandpa to make a vow.

37:10.950 --> 37:13.070
We don't owe each other anything anymore.

37:13.070 --> 37:14.530
As for the pine appraisal,

37:14.710 --> 37:15.630
I had no choice

37:16.150 --> 37:17.670
since I have debts

37:17.880 --> 37:18.760
to pay.

37:18.880 --> 37:20.810
I had to make a bet with Luo Wensong.

37:20.880 --> 37:22.340
I have no ulterior motive.

37:22.630 --> 37:24.800
My grandfather
doesn't know about this either.

37:24.800 --> 37:26.110
Don't you slander us!

37:26.150 --> 37:27.880
Whether it's slander

37:27.930 --> 37:30.560
or you're just good at quibbling,

37:30.760 --> 37:32.280
I'm sure everyone knows.

37:32.750 --> 37:35.750
If it weren't because
Seventh Grandmother liked you,

37:35.800 --> 37:37.190
you would have been

37:37.550 --> 37:40.070
kicked out of Shexian

37:40.070 --> 37:41.400
and Huizhou.

37:42.110 --> 37:43.710
I hope you suffer
for the rest of your life

37:43.710 --> 37:46.170
and will never be able to turn things around!

37:48.400 --> 37:49.590
All these years,

37:50.950 --> 37:52.960
our family has been atoning for
losing the rights to Tribute Ink

37:52.960 --> 37:54.280
and the loss of our kin.

37:55.440 --> 37:57.040
But it has already happened.

37:57.760 --> 37:59.190
We can't change the past.

38:00.070 --> 38:02.510
We just want to live an honest life

38:02.550 --> 38:04.400
and help our family survive.

38:05.230 --> 38:07.960
Why won't you give us a way out?

38:08.110 --> 38:10.710
It's not that I can't forgive you,

38:11.400 --> 38:14.000
but that Li Ink can't forgive

38:14.110 --> 38:15.760
those who betray our ancestors

38:15.760 --> 38:18.400
and destroy our ancestors' foundation.

38:25.400 --> 38:26.190
Zhen.

38:26.510 --> 38:27.040
Let's go.

38:27.050 --> 38:28.570
Grandpa, let me finish.

38:30.150 --> 38:32.950
Many things happened to my family
when I was a child.

38:32.950 --> 38:34.180
Though I was a child,

38:34.510 --> 38:35.880
I know everything happened

38:35.880 --> 38:37.760
because of ink.

38:38.510 --> 38:39.480
From then on,

38:40.030 --> 38:41.110
ink became

38:41.110 --> 38:42.570
an unspoken taboo at home.

38:43.880 --> 38:44.960
All these years,

38:45.670 --> 38:46.710
Grandpa, Mother,

38:47.070 --> 38:47.920
Brother,

38:48.230 --> 38:48.960
and I

38:49.110 --> 38:50.710
have been very careful.

38:51.590 --> 38:53.480
We've been avoiding it,

38:53.480 --> 38:55.670
wanting to just live our own lives.

38:56.480 --> 38:57.710
But there are always people

38:57.710 --> 38:59.510
who wouldn't let us off the hook.

39:00.110 --> 39:02.570
The Luo family
covets Grandpa's ink recipe.

39:03.000 --> 39:05.930
The Tian family
wants Grandpa's ink-making skills.

39:06.400 --> 39:08.440
You threaten us only because

39:08.670 --> 39:10.880
you're afraid of what Grandpa
has mastered throughout his life—

39:10.880 --> 39:13.030
you're afraid that the Eighth Branch
will be able to start anew.

39:13.030 --> 39:14.150
No matter what we do,

39:14.150 --> 39:16.030
it is always wrong in your eyes.

39:17.070 --> 39:18.270
Since I can't escape,

39:19.030 --> 39:20.000
I shan't

39:20.550 --> 39:21.960
hide anymore.

39:23.190 --> 39:24.280
We will

39:24.800 --> 39:26.400
continue to stay in Huizhou.

39:26.400 --> 39:27.860
We're not going anywhere.

39:28.070 --> 39:30.270
We will live a better life than you, too!

39:33.150 --> 39:34.150
Uncle Jingdong.

39:35.110 --> 39:36.190
Fourth Aunt.

39:37.280 --> 39:38.880
Just watch!

39:39.840 --> 39:40.710
Third Brother.

39:41.030 --> 39:42.280
Stop wasting your breath on them.

39:42.280 --> 39:43.840
Drive them away! Shoo!

39:43.960 --> 39:44.760
I'm sorry.

39:44.960 --> 39:45.360
I'm sorry.

39:45.360 --> 39:46.110
Don't touch my grandpa!

39:46.110 --> 39:46.510
Sorry.

39:46.510 --> 39:47.460
Don't touch my grandpa!

39:47.460 --> 39:48.450
We'll leave.

39:48.480 --> 39:49.140
Don't move!

39:49.360 --> 39:50.000
I'm sorry.

39:50.000 --> 39:50.660
Don't move!

39:50.880 --> 39:51.670
Don't move!

39:51.880 --> 39:52.710
Don't move!

39:52.800 --> 39:53.110
Jin.

39:53.110 --> 39:54.030
Don't you dare move.

39:54.030 --> 39:54.880
I'll kill anyone

39:54.880 --> 39:56.080
who dares to touch us!

39:56.110 --> 39:57.000
What are you doing?

39:57.000 --> 39:57.760
Put down the knife!

39:57.760 --> 39:59.400
The ceremony is completed.

40:27.280 --> 40:27.920
Zhen.

40:28.360 --> 40:28.960
Zhen!

40:30.150 --> 40:30.670
What...

40:30.670 --> 40:32.030
What are you doing?

40:34.030 --> 40:34.920
From now on,

40:35.400 --> 40:38.190
this will be the ancestral altar
for the Eighth Branch.

40:38.190 --> 40:38.710
You...

40:38.880 --> 40:40.150
Nonsense!

40:40.320 --> 40:42.760
That's not something
you can build at will!

40:47.760 --> 40:48.480
Zhen.

40:48.800 --> 40:49.860
What are you doing?

40:57.070 --> 40:58.070
Stop right there!

41:00.550 --> 41:01.760
How can you touch

41:02.590 --> 41:04.250
the Grandmaster's portrait!

41:05.800 --> 41:06.530
Zhengliang.

41:07.760 --> 41:09.400
Bring back the Grandmaster's

41:09.400 --> 41:10.230
portrait.

41:13.480 --> 41:14.280
Zhen.

41:16.360 --> 41:17.000
Zhen.

41:17.030 --> 41:18.360
How inappropriate!

41:23.960 --> 41:25.880
Even if you want to worship the ancestors,

41:25.880 --> 41:27.880
you don't have to go to the Li family.

41:27.960 --> 41:29.630
There is no rule saying

41:29.920 --> 41:31.840
we can't build our own ancestral hall.

41:31.840 --> 41:32.880
Zhen.

41:34.310 --> 41:35.940
One stroke can't write two Li's.

41:35.940 --> 41:38.020
It can't write one either.

41:38.480 --> 41:40.510
Breaking rules to build an ancestral altar

41:40.510 --> 41:41.590
is better than you being humiliated

41:41.590 --> 41:43.590
by going to the Li family
to blindly practice filial piety.

41:43.590 --> 41:44.850
Have you thought about

41:45.480 --> 41:46.810
Mother, Brother, and me

41:47.390 --> 41:49.130
when you acted like this today?

41:50.110 --> 41:51.880
We are your family!

41:51.960 --> 41:52.760
Grandpa.

41:53.510 --> 41:54.920
Zhen is right.

41:55.880 --> 41:57.540
I will take what you said today

42:00.000 --> 42:01.480
as a joke.

42:03.190 --> 42:04.520
Don't mention it again.

42:05.590 --> 42:06.760
You were forced

42:07.070 --> 42:09.190
by them to make the vow.

42:09.590 --> 42:11.550
And today,
you were bullied by them like that.

42:11.550 --> 42:13.320
My heart aches.

42:15.590 --> 42:17.280
I hate your foolishness.

42:19.110 --> 42:20.880
But I hate myself for not being able

42:20.880 --> 42:22.070
to protect you.

42:24.000 --> 42:25.360
From now on,

42:26.150 --> 42:27.760
I won't allow anyone

42:27.760 --> 42:29.360
to bully our family again.

42:30.920 --> 42:33.030
They're afraid
that we will start an ink business

42:33.030 --> 42:34.510
and that we will do well.

42:35.320 --> 42:36.580
I will do exactly that.

42:37.000 --> 42:39.030
I will live even better than they do.

42:39.360 --> 42:40.480
From now on,

42:41.190 --> 42:41.960
I,

42:42.360 --> 42:44.280
swearing to our ancestors,

42:45.000 --> 42:46.960
will start learning ink blending.

42:47.880 --> 42:50.610
Every bit of shame
the Eighth Branch has endured,

42:50.840 --> 42:53.920
every ounce of dignity
my father and grandfather lost—

42:54.320 --> 42:55.520
I will take it all back

42:55.800 --> 42:58.000
with ink, in the light of day.

42:59.670 --> 43:00.550
Grandpa!

43:01.030 --> 43:02.670
Please teach me how to make ink!
